# Generated by `xcodegen generate` in sample/sample-ios-app from the project.yml beside them.
# Committing a pbxproj means committing thousands of lines of machine-written plist that nobody
# reviews and every Xcode version rewrites; the spec is the reviewable artefact.
#
# Both named by path rather than by glob. `*.xcodeproj/` would also swallow a hand-written project
# somebody adds later, which is the one case where the pbxproj is the source and has to be
# committed.
sample/sample-ios-app/SampleIos.xcodeproj/
sample/sample-ios-app/Info.plist
